{"id":"PM-2026-02","kind":"postmortem","title":"Gateway retry amplification","service":"edge-gateway","severity":"SEV-1","category":"API","date":"2026-02-11","root_cause":"Unbounded retries amplified a partial provider failure.","resolution":"Rolled back retry policy and added capped exponential backoff and a circuit breaker.","duration_minutes":31,"content":"Post-mortem PM-2026-02: Gateway retry amplification. Root cause: unbounded retries amplified a partial provider failure. Resolution: rollback, capped exponential backoff, jitter and breaker. Lessons: retries consume capacity and need explicit budgets."},
{"id":"PM-2026-03","kind":"postmortem","title":"Expired webhook certificate","service":"webhook-service","severity":"SEV-2","category":"Certificates","date":"2026-03-02","root_cause":"Certificate renewal failed after challenge credentials were rotated without alerting.","resolution":"Restored credentials and renewed the certificate.","duration_minutes":36,"content":"Post-mortem PM-2026-03: Expired webhook certificate. Root cause: renewal failed after challenge credentials rotated. Resolution: restored credentials and renewed. Lessons: test external TLS and alert on certificate expiry."},
